\code{\link[=avg_p]{avg_p()}}, \code{\link[=dc]{dc()}}, \code{\link[=maam]{maam()}}, \code{\link[=mult_k]{mult_k()}}, \code{\link[=mort_q]{mort_q()}}, \code{\link[=time_mort_q]{time_mort_q()}},
\code{\link[=mort_alpha]{mort_alpha()}}, \code{\link[=mort_convert_q]{mort_convert_q()}}. To choose the model family, \code{\link[=plot_mlt]{plot_mlt()}}
plots observed 1q0 and 4q1 against the patterns of the model life tables.
}
